# Rock Climb, on the wall inside Victory Road's first floor.
#
# The wall is a run of tile behaviours rather than an object, found with the
# port's own map scan: a north-south rock-climb column with cave floor at its
# foot. The player stands on that floor facing it.

name CLIMBER
gender GENDER_MALE
trainer-id 30005
money 3000
badge BADGE_ID_ICICLE
party SPECIES_BIBAREL 30 ITEM_NONE
party-move 0 0 MOVE_ROCK_CLIMB
map MAP_HEADER_VICTORY_ROAD_1F 22 38 FACE_UP
